 a new visual entertainment service that transforms past VR and 3D live performances into high-quality 3D experiences you can easily enjoy on your MetaQuest.\n\nLike DVDs or Blu-rays, you can purchase past live shows and replay them anytime, on your favorite device.\nRelive the excitement of immersive live performances\u2014anytime, anywhere, right on your MetaQuest.\n\n\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\n\n\u25c6Experience the Live Show \u201cIn Spacial\u201d\nFeel the depth and immersion that flat videos can\u2019t deliver.\nIt\u2019s like being there at the concert all over again.\n\n\u25c6One-Time Purchase, Yours Forever\nOwn your favorite live shows digitally\u2014just like Blu-rays.\nEnjoy them anytime without subscription or streaming limits.\n\n\u25c6Enjoy smooth playback, even for demanding 3D live shows.\nBecause the performances are pre-rendered as video, even heavy 3D content plays back smoothly.\nEnjoy high-quality live shows without any lag or stress.\n\n\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc", "short_description": "This is a new video experience service that turns past VR and 3D live events into high-quality 3D footage that can be easily enjoyed on Meta Quest."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gugenka.jp/services/spatialdisk/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://gugenka.jp/services/spatialdisk/terms", "publisher_name": "Gugenka Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://gugenka.jp/contact", "website_url": "https://gugenka.jp/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ja"], "supported_input_de